WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.730
You fight dirty!

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.530
Consider yourself fortunate.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:39.240
If it wasn't for the limiter on my arm, you'd be dead.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.410
I'm done playing.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:48.040
Adios, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.290
Chaos Control!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.680
Don't worry.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.140
We'll meet again soon, buddy!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.080
Day 2   6:30

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.080
Prison Island Deluxe Suite

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:23.050
Episode 35

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:23.050
Escape from Prison Island

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:38.420
He can't escape unless he's a magician.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:43.260
And even if he manages to escape, he's surrounded by the ocean.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:47.140
Sonic doesn't like the water, so he's helpless.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:51.150
And check out the tight security!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.110
It's impregnable!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:59.200
Infrared laser nets and reinforced walls.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.660
Voice, fingerprint and retinal scans.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:05.660
Sound, temperature and pressure detectors.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.910
We have many hi-tech devices!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.710
Escape is impossible!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:16.710
Professionals can bring any weapons they want, and it's still impregnable!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:20.340
This security system is a work of art.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.130
They'll be helpless!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.050
Trying would be mission impossible!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.940
Punish that arrogant hedgehog!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.900
I just can't believe that Sonic would do something like this.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.820
Well, I guess it's good to take it easy once in a while.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:57.590
If we sail any further, Prison Island's surveillance radar will detect us.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:06.180
They have the newest high-tech detection system for their defense.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.260
So what can we do?

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.680
Leave everything to me.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.770
We'll combat high-tech with analog technology.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:22.450
This is the best way to get to the island without raising suspicion.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.750
Just wait, Sonic.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.500
We're coming to your rescue!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.710
Chris, let's start pedaling faster.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.880
Something's approaching!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.300
What is it?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.600
That's a swan boat.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:51.020
Swan boats are for people going on dates.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.480
What kind of couple are on that swan boat?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.270
What should we do?

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.690
Should we report this?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:02.940
No, it's fine.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.860
It's too crazy to be a problem.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.070
And I push this.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.080
What?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.160
What's going on?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.210
Is an enemy attacking?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.000
We don't know anything!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:26.260
Dr. Eggman has entered Prison Island! That's another success!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.640
We did it!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:39.360
I never thought I'd be coming back here again.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:48.820
Dr. Eggman, I can't believe you let the female bat sweet talk you.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:55.660
Due to the previous invasion, they've greatly fortified the security!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:01.540
No matter how tight the security, there's no such thing as a perfect system as long as it's man-made.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.260
You must always be careful.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.590
You're so cool, Dr. Eggman!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:13.930
My goal is to activate the Eclipse Cannon, the ultimate weapon that's been sealed away.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.770
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:23.270
Is the Chaos Emerald really stored inside the GUN military base?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.990
It's up to you whether you believe me or not.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.110
She's definitely lying.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.820
Test her!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.120
Whatever.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.790
Now I'll explain the plan.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:43.130
I'll go first and distract GUN while you enter the base.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:48.220
Next, Shadow will place this in the ammunition warehouse.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:52.890
We don't want them chasing us, so we'll blow up the entire island.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:03.060
Rouge, you will steal the Chaos Emerald from the storehouse.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.650
Show me your treasure hunting skills.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.530
The time limit is 30 minutes.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:12.660
Keep in mind that we won't get a second chance!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.200
Let's go!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.330
What's happening?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.880
Is Sonic fighting?

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.420
We have to land immediately!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.010
Sonic!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.640
I really missed you! I'm glad you're okay!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:25.190
I came to rescue you, but it seems it was unnecessary.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.310
Sonic?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.120
You're not Sonic! Who are you?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.870
Don't interfere! We're busy!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.370
Dr. Eggman!

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.750
Shadow and Rouge, I'll handle this. You go on ahead.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.550
Stay away!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.800
Amy!

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.520
Eggman, what are you up to now?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:11.730
Shut up!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.440
Take this!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:42.970
That wasn't Sonic. Who was he?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.940
Sonic, where are you?

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:58.610
Shadow will place a bomb in the ammunition warehouse.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:04.040
Rouge, you will steal the Chaos Emerald from the storehouse.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:08.960
Show me your treasure hunting skills.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.680
This looks like the place.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:28.060
I can smell beautiful objects.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.560
This is an easy lock to open.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.300
Damn! He's so persistent.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.960
Dr. Eggman.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.380
You don't have the time to waste on him.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.930
That's right!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.100
I know!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.980
Tails, let's call it a draw.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.310
But it'll be different next time!

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.440
Be ready!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.170
Amy?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.920
Amy...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.920
I've returned.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.180
Don't worry. We'll meet again soon!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.010
Sonic...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.720
Doctor, it's all set.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.770
What should I set the time to?

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.810
I encountered unexpected resistance.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.560
We no longer have any time to waste.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.520
Shadow, set the bomb to explode in fifteen minutes.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.070
Got that, Rouge?

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.440
All I need is five minutes.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.780
Then let's split the difference and set it for ten minutes.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.110
Roger.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:06.340
Hi, Sonic! Amy Rose makes her graceful entrance!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.810
Intruders detected!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.020
Gold Beetle, go!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.280
Flying Dog, go!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:29.830
The guard robot Flying Dog is a combat robot that's an improved version of Hot Shot.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:38.040
Not only is it more durable, but its flight speed and attack power have also been improved!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.590
Who are you explaining this to?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:45.550
Its weapons are the Vulcan cannon, homing missiles and energy bombs!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.310
Would you like me to open the door?

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.310
You seem to be in a lot of trouble.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.940
Actually, I'm quite comfortable.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.900
You might want to change your attitude.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.770
Amy, behind you!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.030
What do you want?

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.450
Don't interrupt me at such an important time!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.830
Wow! Good job!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.250
Step back, Sonic. I'll smash it open.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.880
Wait, Amy! Stop!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.760
A loving heart and flames of passion are unstoppable!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:31.720
Amy, I deliberately got caught so that I could find the impostor.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.140
Impostor?

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.890
You mean the black hedgehog?

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.060
You met him? Where is he?

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.270
Do you want me to tell you?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.860
Of course!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.700
If I tell you, will you promise to go on a date with me?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.320
Stand back, Amy.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.530
Why?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.120
I'll break the door myself and go after him!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:59.160
And I thought this would be a great chance to make you promise to go on a date.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.670
Oh well, I'll tell you.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:06.550
The black hedgehog was standing by the entrance with Eggman.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.800
So Eggman's behind this again.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.550
What are those doodles on the wall?

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.970
So he's by the entrance.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.970
Okay, I'm breaking out of here!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.560
Amy, use that to get us out of here.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.900
Okay!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.650
Impressive, Amy!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.160
He escaped!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.410
Sonic!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:43.330
Chris, since it's too dangerous, please wait here.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:49.300
I'm sorry, Tanaka. I'm worried about Sonic!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.850
Sonic, I'm glad that you're safe.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.890
Chris is-

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.360
Long time no see, Tanaka.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.440
How's Ella? Where's Chris?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.360
This isn't the time for chitchat, Amy.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.450
Tails, take care of Amy.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.610
I'm going to look for the black hedgehog!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.790
Wait a minute, Sonic!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.040
How beautiful.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.250
You're early.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.800
I thought I could enjoy myself a bit longer.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.380
Flying Dog to Headquarters.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.640
I found the intruder! I'm preparing to attack!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:36.760
Roger!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.790
I found you, Shadow.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.590
Let's settle things once and for all!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.210
You don't know your place.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.700
I messed up at the very end.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:48.630
Time bomb detected.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:54.130
All personnel, evacuate immediately.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:59.390
Chris!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.930
Chris is missing!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.140
I'll go look for him!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:07.190
Chris!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.790
Shadow...

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.250
Sorry, but I messed up.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.970
I'm trapped in the safe along with the Chaos Emerald.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.930
With this mistake, I've failed as a treasure hunter.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.470
Huh?

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.140
What do you want?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.140
What do I want? What kind of response is that?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:55.110
That's just great. You're going to abandon me?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.110
Solve your own problem.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.950
It was stupid of me to think that I could rely on him!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.580
Sonic...

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.630
I'm going to die here along with the Chaos Emerald?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.510
Shadow, can you hear me? Shadow!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.860
Shadow, what are you doing?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.900
The bomb is going to explode soon!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:40.200
If you don't hurry up and leave, you'll blow up along with this island!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:41.950
Blow up?

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.950
There's less than two minutes until it explodes.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.580
I'm getting out of here. Bye!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.830
I have to evacuate everyone!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:19:59.760
It's Sonic!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.470
Sonic!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.350
That's not Sonic.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.310
Maria.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.900
Just when I got my hands on three Chaos Emeralds...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.530
Can you hear me, Rouge? Rouge?

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.740
Shadow!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.570
Do you have the Chaos Emeralds?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.370
I have three of them!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.620
Then I'll come over.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.120
You're just coming here to get the Chaos Emeralds?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.130
Doctor, I'm going to retrieve the Chaos Emeralds.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:45.930
Please, Shadow.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:50.640
I know, Maria. I'll get revenge on everyone!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.520
Chaos Control!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:21:00.360
The only thing I can do for Sonic is to prove his innocence!

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.740
Chris!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.570
Chris?

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.660
Chris has...

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.200
Shadow...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.460
Chaos-

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.760
Wait a second. What are you going to do about this boy?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.680
I don't care what happens to him.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:35.140
Wait. My friend is in trouble because he was mistaken for you.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:40.820
Please help me save Sonic.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.820
Sonic is my dear friend.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.450
Please!

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.120
Please, Shadow.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:50.830
Maria...

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Chris!

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.340 --> 00:25:35.360
A Threat from Outer Space
